MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- campaignEditor: add whatsapp_template field (EDITABLE_FIELDS, normalize, buildUpdate)
- Campaigns: WA button opens editable popup before opening WhatsApp; Edit form has template textarea with variable hints ({username} {campaign} {agent} {gap})
- kpi: total_turnover now includes BLACK tier (was missing from PLATINUM+DIAMOND)
- kpi: upgrade_count filters PLATINUM→DIAMOND only (was counting all tier changes)
- ActiveTracker: use get_last_active_dates RPC for last-active lookup

